          "title": "On-street Car Parking Sensor Data - 2019",
          "description": "<p>The City of Melbourne has installed in-ground parking bay sensors in most CBD parking bays. These sensors record when a vehicle arrives and when it departs. Each record also includes the parking restriction for the bay and whether the vehicle has overstayed that restriction. An event will include if a vehicle was present or not which can determine stay time and vacancy time.</p><p style=\"font-family: sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Download:</span></p><p style=\"font-family: sans-serif;\"><a href=\"https://opendatasoft-s3.s3.amazonaws.com/downloads/archive/7pgd-bdf2.zip\" target=\"_blank\">Download</a> compressed CSV (717.1MB, 42.7 million rows)</p>",
